# Prepares the built fixture human-priest-mage-seed4-gate for the checks that load it (bd inc-10v7f).
# The old fixture, a .sav, held this state: wizard mode on with Free Advancement, and a Mage level added to
# the Priest (Priest 1 / Mage 1), which teaches Shield beside the priest's Cure Light Wounds.
# setup-human-priest-mage-wounded-seed4-gate.keys includes this file.
# Ruling V7-1: a fixture holds only the created character, so the checks that need the state make it here.
@while "more --" SPACE
w
@while "Enter wizard mode" y
@until "Wizard Mode Options" w
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN DOWN
SPACE                   # Free Advancement, so the Mage level can be bought
ESC
d
@expect "Class  Priest 1"
M
@choose "Mage"
G
@choose "Mage"
@until "Mage 1" a
ESC
